/devplat
/dist/
*.exe

# Release signing private key. Generated by scripts/gen-release-key.sh into the
# repo root, because that is where the script runs and where you will look for
# it — which makes an ignore rule mandatory rather than tidy. One `git add -A`
# without this line publishes the one secret whose entire purpose is being
# somewhere an attacker cannot reach.
#
# The *.pub.pem sibling is deliberately not ignored: the public half belongs in
# the tree, and build-release.sh also writes one into dist/ for publishing.
devplat-release-key.pem
devplat-release-key*.pem
!devplat-release-key*.pub.pem
